#
# topsatenCountNonzero (reached through aten::argwhere's composite
# decomposition on a gcu tensor) rejects rank > 8 with the same
# TOPSATEN_STATUS_BAD_PARAM hard process abort as the random/fill kernels
# above, so the accuracy harness's reference arm dies on the very
# high-rank cases it is supposed to check. Route gcu inputs with rank > 8
# through CPU aten for an independent ground truth (the D2H/H2D round
# trip is value-exact, and argwhere's output is freshly allocated
# int64 indices) and move the result back to the original device. Every
# other call shape -- all bench/native arms included -- passes straight
# through to the original callable. Drop once topsatenCountNonzero
# validates rank instead of terminating.
